Subject: [PATCH] Label the opt-in ADB diagnostic build property

Use the existing read-only build property type, without adding allow rules.

--- a/private/property_contexts
+++ b/private/property_contexts
@@ -1166,6 +1166,7 @@
 
 ro.adb.has_usb u:object_r:system_adbd_prop:s0 exact bool
 ro.adb.secure u:object_r:build_prop:s0 exact bool
+ro.bigme.debug_adb u:object_r:build_prop:s0 exact bool
 ro.secure     u:object_r:userdebug_or_eng_prop:s0 exact int
 
 ro.product.system_ext.brand        u:object_r:build_prop:s0 exact string
